          "text": "Description: Recent testimony (06/18/2014) of an old observation that the witness cannot recall the exact date. One winter evening at 1 AM, a witness closing their gate was startled by the presence of a large, silent, pale white spiral moving. No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon. This atypical observation case may evoke an exceptional meteorological phenomenon. However, the account is old, not detailed, and the precise date unknown. The GEIPAN cannot process this case due to lack of information, thus it is classified \"C\".",
